Modifications
-------------
Files of the upstream archive were modified and files were added for use as an external baseline on a
different data source (public PUBG match telemetry stored in PostgreSQL).  Every change is listed in
README_ADAPTATION.md; the changes to upstream files are reproduced exactly as a unified diff against the
unmodified upstream archive in ADAPTATION.patch, and the added files (adaptation/, PARITY_TABLE.csv,
README_ADAPTATION.md, ADAPTATION.patch, this NOTICE) are listed in README_ADAPTATION.md.  Modified files carry
the notice "Modified from krafton-ai/pubg-winprob (99ed9d1) - see README_ADAPTATION.md" at the top.

The modified code is NOT the code that KRAFTON published and must not be described as such; results
obtained with it are results of the adapted implementation described in README_ADAPTATION.md.
